{"synopsis":"Tumbuh sebagai yatim piatu Jeong HeJin tidak membuka hatinya kepada siapa pun\nSetelah memberikan segalanya untuk menjadi ahli bedah kardiotoraks ia mengalami kecelakaan yang tidak menguntungkan\nsetelah itu ia bangun bukan sebagai Jeon HeJin tetapi sebagai Choi GiSeok\nDan di atas semua itu dia harus Level Up menggunakan keahliannya\nKecelakaan itu mengubah nasibnya secara drastis \nBisakah dia menjadi Ahli Bedah Kardiotoraks Terhebat sebagai Choi GiSeok","alternative_title":"레벨업 닥터 최기석","author":"Yun Baekhyun","artist":"Jang Sun Hye, Zilpung Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"68d44151-7fda-4537-b45a-7ea250c232b0","number":"87","chapter":"87","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"aba492ef-3fb3-4cd4-9bf9-333a6a03f0b3","number":"86","chapter":"86","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"614238b0-8879-400f-b6c1-e6c692dc1f07","number":"85","chapter":"85","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"56c5a53c-fb85-48bc-9621-25b7eb32f4b1","number":"84","chapter":"84","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"5140e64a-e167-4c3a-93f7-b0dba9f3988f","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"e3b2472a-50fc-4666-8d1f-bfc0cbecfb69","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"077d3dfc-256d-47ea-8ff0-a53f5c8e47a4","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"6d69d9e2-4496-40df-bd98-38b14d23bce2","number":"80","chapter":"80","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"cf999210-7d21-4d69-bbe7-2e7f67703077","number":"79","chapter":"79","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"2fe40b51-485e-4059-b4c1-46fc0c9f82fb","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"","date":"2024-11-22","released":"2024-11-22"},{"chapter_id":"9c35f09c-7ee4-4b11-944